{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "CAPTAIN FIRAT",
    "steam_appid": 3817110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/ee3299d0f97ebc2ea0c5113270e9968d.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0The world is a vast, beautiful and dangerous place, especially if you're stranded on an island full of cursed skeletons. Find ways to escape from this island together with the villagers on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Uncover the mysteries while playing through the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who did this to you? How do you go home? These are all answers you will uncover as you play through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0It\u2019s time to go big, or never go home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/5353cbfd9dc238cae4eeb19502c053a2.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Craft weapons and kill cursed skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/1127143747c67062b3b9a6cedb73c2a6.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Gather materials and build on the island.\u00a0Spears, Axes, Bows, Spearguns, and so much more can all be crafted through an interactive crafting menu or by the quick-craft selection wheel. Items in your inventory and on the ground around you can all be crafted into something useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/ac9e1920e209a7d79ddcb9223917ea7f.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0If you are hungry, the easiest way is to fish.\u00a0Hunt, Fish, Trap, and Skin animals for food or kill to insert your dominance over the pacific islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/eddbef4bf3caaf36bc3bb44dd0ed2740.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0neglecting animals on the farm.\u00a0Build and manage your farm with water management and plant growth cycles.\u00a0Create your own custom island and add it to your survival world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/ee3299d0f97ebc2ea0c5113270e9968d.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0The world is a vast, beautiful and dangerous place, especially if you're stranded on an island full of cursed skeletons. Find ways to escape from this island together with the villagers on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Uncover the mysteries while playing through the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who did this to you? How do you go home? These are all answers you will uncover as you play through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0It\u2019s time to go big, or never go home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/5353cbfd9dc238cae4eeb19502c053a2.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Craft weapons and kill cursed skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/1127143747c67062b3b9a6cedb73c2a6.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Gather materials and build on the island.\u00a0Spears, Axes, Bows, Spearguns, and so much more can all be crafted through an interactive crafting menu or by the quick-craft selection wheel. Items in your inventory and on the ground around you can all be crafted into something useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/ac9e1920e209a7d79ddcb9223917ea7f.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0If you are hungry, the easiest way is to fish.\u00a0Hunt, Fish, Trap, and Skin animals for food or kill to insert your dominance over the pacific islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817110/extras/eddbef4bf3caaf36bc3bb44dd0ed2740.avif?t=1752599020\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0neglecting animals on the farm.\u00a0Build and manage your farm with water management and plant growth cycles.\u00a0Create your own custom island and add it to your survival world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
